#chip 18F4550, 20

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Time unit '10us' (tens of microseconds) on 18F4550
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 2,500 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 50 10us
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
